al network path"},"405":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#what-the-lamassu-chart-provides","content":"TLS"},"406":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#what-the-lamassu-chart-provides","content":"cert-manager `Issuer` and CA `Certificate` resources; either a chart-managed downstream `Certificate` or a reference to your TLS Secret"},"407":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#what-the-lamassu-chart-provides","content":"cert-manager itself; for trusted TLS, a trusted issuer or a populated TLS Secret"},"408":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#what-the-lamassu-chart-provides","content":"Persistent application data"},"409":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#what-the-lamassu-chart-provides","content":"PersistentVolumeClaims required by the default local KMS and VA storage"},"410":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#what-the-lamassu-chart-provides","content":"A StorageClass, physical storage, bac