preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"Everything returns 403 or 5xx"},"440":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"A pod is not Ready"},"441":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"Events are not arriving"},"442":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"Observability"},"443":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","content":"Start by locating the failing layer. A Gateway response and an unready pod require different evidence. For rejected issuance or validation results, see PKI troubleshooting; for enrollment, see EST diagnostics."},"444":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#reproduce-a-single-operation","content":"Note the time in UTC, user or principal, resource, endpoint and result. Avoid repeating a destructive action such as revocation or deletion."},"445":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#separate-client-gateway-and-service","content":"Check the HTTP status. A 401 points to authentication; a 403, to authorization; a 404, to route or resource; a 5xx, to the service or a dependency."},"446":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#review-kubernetes-status","content":"Locate unready pods, restarts, recent events and the state of the release."},"447":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#query-the-affected-service","content":"Review its /health endpoint and its logs in the same time window. Then follow the indicated dependency: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, the OIDC provider or the cryptographic engine."},"448":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#validate-the-result-from-outside","content":"For PKI, check the certificate, the chain, OCSP or CRL with the same type of client production uses."},"449":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"Replace the placeholders with your real release, namespace and deployment."},"450":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"Also run the chart's connectivity test:"},"451":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"The test checks the health of CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager and VA, and verifies that the UI returns HTML. A passing test confirms basic connectivity, not a full issuance flow."},"452":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"The chart's services expose startup, readiness and liveness probes over /health. A pod can be running but receive no traffic if the readiness probe fails."},"453":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"If you receive a 401:"},"454":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"check that the UI's OIDC authority is reachable from the browser;"},"455":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"verify issuer, audience and expiration of the token;"},"456":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"confirm the Gateway can fetch the keys from the JWKS URI;"},"457":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"check that the provider's public and internal routes point to the same realm."},"458":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"If login succeeds but the APIs return 403:"},"459":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"inspect the token's real claims;"},"460":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"confirm they match an active principal;"},"461":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"review the policies granted to that principal;"},"462":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"verify that authz reaches PostgreSQL and its JWKS."},"463":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"On a fresh installation, confirm the migration Job finished. That Job creates schemas, migrates authz, preloads policies and provisions the principals defined in services.authz.bootstrap."},"464":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"External authorization fails closed by default. If authz is unavailable, protected routes are blocked."},"465":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"Locate the authz pod and Service."},"466":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"Check /health, logs and its database connection."},"467":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"Verify the DNS and port configured in externalAuthorization."},"468":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"Check the check route is /v1/ext\\_authz/check."},"469":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"Do not switch to failOpen: true as a permanent workaround: it would allow traffic without authorization during the outage."},"470":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"Review kubectl describe pod first. Common causes are:"},"471":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"wrong credentials or DNS for PostgreSQL or RabbitMQ;"},"472":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"unbound persistent volume;"},"473":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"inaccessible image or incorrect pull policy;"},"474":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"invalid cryptographic engine configuration;"},"475":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"CPU or memory limits set too low;"},"476":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"an incomplete prior migration."},"477":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"Generic values request 100 mCPU and 128 MiB and limit to 500 mCPU and 512 MiB. Tune per service when you see OOMKills, throttling or slow startups."},"478":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"Filesystem-based KMS engines and VA local storage use exclusive-access volumes. Keep a single replica or migrate to shared backends before enabling autoscaling."},"479":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"Domain and audit events depend on the bus publisher:"},"480":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"verify it is enabled in the emitting service;"},"481":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"check AMQP connectivity and credentials;"},"482":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"review exchange, routing key, queues and consumers;"},"483":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"inspect dead-letter queues;"},"484":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"alert on orphan durable queues and backlog growth."},"485":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"A consumer outage does not always prevent the main operation from completing. That is why you must monitor RabbitMQ and independently verify the persistence of audit logs."},"486":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"The chart can enable OpenTelemetry instrumentation. Traces are exported over OTLP HTTP and logs can be directed to a compatible endpoint, such as VictoriaLogs. Use a correlation identifier and the same time window to join Gateway, authz, service and dependency."},"487":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"Before closing an incident, record:"},"488":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"the confirmed cause;"},"489":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"the time scope and affected resources;"},"490":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"the commands or queries used;"},"491":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"the applied change and how to revert it;"},"492":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"validation from a consumer;"},"493":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"the preventive action and its owner."},"494":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/administration/access-control","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/administration/access-control","type":"page","content":"Access control","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","Administration"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/administration/access-control"},"495":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/administration/access-control-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/administration/access-control","con