ngine that supports the chosen algorithm."},"2288":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#before-you-begin","content":"OpenSSL 3.x to check the downloaded certificate."},"2289":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#before-you-begin","content":"Use an evaluation instance or an authority intended for these tests. The example creates a root that issues directly; to design an operational hierarchy, see Hierarchy and rotation."},"2290":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#open-the-creation-wizard","content":"In **Certification Authorities**, select **Create New CA** and choose to create a CA with a new key pair."},"2291":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#open-the-creation-wizard","content":"The &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)** flow is explained in the authorities guide."},"2292":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-p