dy expired CA. To change its key, use Hierarchy and rotation."},"2420":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"Check each boundary independently:"},"2421":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**Record:** read the correct certificate again by serial and issuer. Confirm status, reason and time; expired or permanently revoked records reject further transitions."},"2422":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**Endpoint:** inspect AIA and CDP. Query those URLs from the consumer’s network; an old route or incorrect issuer can explain a discrepancy."},"2423":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**OCSP:** save a fresh response, verify signature and timestamps, and observe status. An HTTP error for an absent serial does not mean `Good` or guarantee a signed `Unknown`."},"2424":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**CRL:** compare `latest_crl`, number and timestamps with the downloaded list. Check the serial in its contents. If unchanged, review `regenerate_on_revoke`, event delivery, jobs, signing and storage with the deployment operator."},"2425":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**Client:** check cache, policy for expired or unavailable evidence, critical IDP extension and rejection of a new connection."},"2426":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"Reactivation from `CertificateHold` needs a new CRL for the client to stop seeing the hold. Reactivating a CA does not restore its descendant cascade; inspect every status and individual operation failure."},"2427":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#the-chain-validates-but-the-connection-fails","content":"Check expected identity, SAN, KU/EKU, matching key, presented intermediates and consumer permissions. Distinguish server TLS trust, client authentication and action authorization. Follow Validation for positive and rejection tests."},"2428":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#the-chain-validates-but-the-connection-fails","content":"When escalating a problem, provide identifiers, error and relevant public evidence, including query timestamps and version. This distinguishes issuance, publication and consumer application failures."}}