ectos para PostgreSQL o RabbitMQ;"},"472":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"volumen persistente sin enlazar;"},"473":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"imagen inaccesible o política de pull incorrecta;"},"474":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"configuración inválida del motor criptográfico;"},"475":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"límites de CPU o memoria demasiado bajos;"},"476":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"migración previa incompleta."},"477":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Los valores genéricos solicitan 100 mCPU y 128 MiB y limitan a 500 mCPU y 512 MiB. Ajusta por servicio cuando haya OOMKills, throttling o arranques lentos."},"478":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Los motores KMS basados en filesystem y el almacenamiento local de VA utilizan volúmenes de acceso exclusivo. Mantén una réplica o migra a backends compartidos antes de habilitar autoscaling."},"479":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos de dominio y auditoría dependen del publisher del bus:"},"480":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"verifica que esté habilitado en el servicio emisor;"},"481":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"comprueba conectividad y credenciales AMQP;"},"482":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"revisa exchange, routing key, colas y consumidores;"},"483":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"inspecciona dead-letter queues;"},"484":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"alerta sobre colas durables huérfanas y crecimiento de backlog."},"485":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Una caída del consumidor no siempre impide que la operación principal termine. Por eso debes monitorizar RabbitMQ y verificar de forma independiente la persistencia de auditoría."},"486":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"El chart puede habilitar instrumentación OpenTelemetry. Las trazas se exportan por OTLP HTTP y los logs pueden dirigirse a un endpoint compatible, como VictoriaLogs. Usa un identificador de correlación y la misma ventana temporal para unir Gateway, authz, servicio y dependencia."},"487":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Antes de cerrar una incidencia, guarda:"},"488":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"causa confirmada;"},"489":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"alcance temporal y recursos afectados;"},"490":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"comandos o consultas utilizados;"},"491":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"cambio aplicado y forma de revertirlo;"},"492":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"validación desde un consumidor;"},"493":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"acción preventiva y propietario."},"494":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/administration/access-control","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"page","content":"Control de acceso","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administración"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/administration/access-control"},"495":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/administration/access-control-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/administration/access-control","content":"Diseña quién puede acceder a Lamassu mediante principales, políticas, permisos sobre recursos y autorización de rutas HTTP."},"496":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/administration/access-control-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/adminis