rl":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"Para un recorrido desde el cliente hasta mTLS, sigue Enrola y conecta tu primer dispositivo con un ID nuevo."},"1611":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"Para utilizar la identidad en AWS IoT Core, prepara también la confianza y los permisos del destino. Comprueba la conexión desde el dispositivo después de instalar la clave, el certificado y la cadena necesarios."},"1612":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview","type":"page","content":"Plataforma Lamassu IoT","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview"},"1613":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview","content":"Construye una PKI y aplica sus certificados al ciclo de vida de tus dispositivos."},"1614":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview#empieza-aquí","content":"Empieza aquí"},"1615":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"Elige tu recorrido"},"1616":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platfo