uickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un motor criptográfico disponible que admita el algoritmo elegido."},"2287":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"OpenSSL 3.x para comprobar el certificado descargado."},"2288":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Utiliza una instancia de evaluación o una autoridad destinada a estas pruebas. El ejemplo crea una raíz que emite directamente; para diseñar una jerarquía operativa, consulta Jerarquía y rotación."},"2289":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#abre-el-asistente-de-creación","content":"En **Certification Authorities**, selecciona **Create New CA** y elige crear una CA con un par de claves nuevo."},"2290":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#abre-el-asistente-de-creación","content":"El flujo &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)** se explica en la guía de autoridades."},"2291":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#selecciona-la-clave","content":"Elige el motor que custodiará la clave y un algoritmo permitido por sus capacidades. Para este ejemplo puedes utilizar **EC P-384** si está disponible."},"2292":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#selecciona-la-clave","content":"La clave privada de la CA se utiliza a través del motor. En este recorrido descargarás únicamente el certificado público de la autoridad."},"2293":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"Selecciona **Root CA** y completa:"},"2294":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**CA Name**: `Acme Evaluation Root CA`."},"2295":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**Subject**: los datos de organización y país de tu evaluación."},"2296":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**CA Certificate Expiration**: por ejemplo, un año desde la creación."},"2297":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**: por ejemplo, 90 días, dentro de la vigencia de la CA."},"2298":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"El nombre de la CA se utilizará como `Common Name`. Mantén los usos de CA necesarios para firmar certificados y CRLs."},"2299":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#revisa-y-crea-la-ca","content":"Comprueba motor, algoritmo, sujeto, tipo raíz y fechas. Confirma la creación y anota el identificador de la autoridad para reconocerla en el DMS o en la API."},"2300":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Abre la nueva CA. Debe aparecer activa, mostrar su certificado y permitir acceder a **Issued Certificates**."},"2301":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Descarga o copia el certificado PEM de la autoridad y guárdalo como `ca.pem`. Comprueba que el archivo contiene el bloque completo, incluidos `BEGIN CERTIFICATE` y `END CERTIFICATE`."},"2302":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#comprueba-el-certificado-de-ca","content":"Ejecuta desde el directorio donde guardaste `ca.pem`:"},"2303":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#comprueba-el-certificado-de-ca","content":"Comprueba que sujeto y emisor corresponden a la raíz creada, las fechas incluyen el momento actual, **Basic Constraints** contiene `CA:TRUE` y **Key Usage** permite firmar certificados. El último comando debe devolver `ca.pem: OK`."},"2304":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#comprueba-el-certificado-de-ca","content":"Has elegido explícitamente `ca.pem` como ancla de esta prueba. Que la autofirma sea válida no instala esa confianza en otros consumidores. Consulta la referencia de openssl-verify para las opciones de comprobación."},"2305":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si la creación falla, comprueba permisos, disponibilidad del motor y algoritmo seleccionado."},"2306":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si OpenSSL no lee el archivo, vuelve a copiar el bloque PEM completo."},"2307":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si fallan la firma o las fechas, revisa que hayas descargado el certificado de esta CA y que el reloj del equipo sea correcto."},"2308":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"El diagnóstico PKI reúne las comprobaciones de emisión y dependencias criptográficas."},"2309":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#siguiente-paso","content":"Continúa con Emite y verifica un certificado, utilizando esta autoridad y `ca.pem`."},"2310":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"page","content":"Emite y verifica un certificado","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","PKI","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate"},"2311":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"Emite un certificado de cliente y comprueba contenido, cadena y correspondencia de clave."},"2312":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"2313":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inicia-la-emisión","content":"Inicia la emisión"},"2314":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#elige-el-método","content":"Elige el método"},"2315":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identifica-el-certificado","content":"Identifica el certificado"},"2316":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Configura clave y usos"},"2317":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#emite-y-descarga","content":"Emite y descarga"},"2318":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Verifica el resultado"},"2319":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inspecciona-contenido-y-fechas","content":"Inspecciona contenido y fechas"},"2320":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-la-cadena","content":"Verifica la cadena"},"2321":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#comprueba-que-la-clave-corresponde","content":"Comprueba que la clave corresponde"},"2322":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si el resultado falla"},"2323":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Siguiente paso"},"2324":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"Emitirás un certificado final para `device-001` mediante el flujo de generación de clave y CSR en el navegador. Al terminar conservarás `device.crt`, `device.key` y el certificado público de la raíz emisora, `ca.pem`."},"2325":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA raíz activa con clave de firma disponible y permisos para emitir. Si todavía no existe, sigue Crea tu primera CA."},"2326":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Su certificado público en `ca.pem`; este ejemplo utiliza la raíz creada en el recorrido anterior."},"2327":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"OpenSSL 3.x y un directorio de trabajo con acceso restringido."},"2328":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un identificador para el cliente: aquí usaremos `device-001`."},"2329":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"En este flujo la clave del cliente se genera en el navegador y debes descargarla al finalizar. Si la pierdes, tendrás que generar una clave y emitir otro certificado. El inventario de certificados permite descargar el certificado público, pero no recuperar esta clave."},"2330":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inicia-la-emisión","content":"Abre la CA del recorrido anterior, entra en **Issued Certificates** y selecciona **Issue New**."},"2331":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#elige-el-método","content":"Selecciona **Generate Key & CSR in Browser** para seguir este ejemplo."},"2332":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#elige-el-método","content":"Si la clave debe generarse y permanecer en el sistema de destino, utiliza **Upload Existing CSR**, descrito en la guía de autoridades."},"2333":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identifica-el-certificado","content":"Introduce `device-001` como `Common Name`. Añade los datos de sujeto requeridos por tu política y SANs si el consumidor los utiliza para identificar al cliente."},"2334":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identifica-el-certificado","content":"Si vas a continuar con el registro manual, el `Device ID` será exactamente `device-001`."},"2335":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Elige un algoritmo y tamaño admitidos por el perfil; por ejemplo, ECDSA P-256 si está permitido. Para este certificado de cliente, selecciona **Digital Signature** y **Client Authentication** y emite como certificado final."},"2336":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Solicita, por ejemplo, 30 días de validez, siempre dentro de la vigencia de la CA. Revisa el perfil de emisión si el contenido resultante difiere de lo solicitado."},"2337":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#emite-y-descarga","content":"Confirma la emisión. Guarda el certificado PEM como `device.crt` y la clave privada como `device.key` en el directorio preparado."},"2338":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Comprueba en **Issued Certificates** que el certificado aparece activo. Anota su número de serie y verifica el material descargado con las comprobaciones siguientes."},"2339":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inspecciona-contenido-y-fechas","content":"Comprueba `CN=device-001`, el emisor esperado, fechas vigentes, **Digital Signature** y el uso extendido **TLS Web Client Authentication**. Debe ser un certificado final: no debe declarar `CA:TRUE` ni habilitar **Certificate Sign**. Si **Basic Constraints** está presente, debe indicar `CA:FALSE`. Si solicitaste SANs, revisa que los identificadores esperados aparezcan en el certificado."},"2340":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-la-cadena","content":"El resultado esperado es `device.crt: OK`. Esta comprobación utiliza tu raíz explícita y evalúa la cadena, las fechas y la compatibilidad con el propósito de cliente TLS. La presencia de los usos y nombres esperados se comprueba también mediante la inspección anterior."},"2341":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-la-cadena","content":"Si utilizas una CA intermedia, la raíz confiable debe estar en `ca.pem` y debes aportar las intermedias mediante `-untrusted intermediates.pem`. Esta variante se desarrolla en el modelo de confianza."},"2342":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-la-cadena","content":"El comando no consulta OCSP ni CRL. Para comprobar revocación, continúa con Validación de certificados. Consulta la referencia de openssl-verify para sus opciones."},"2343":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#comprueba-que-la-clave-corresponde","content":"En Bash, compara los dos resúmenes de clave pública:"},"2344":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#comprueba-que-la-clave-corresponde","content":"Ambos comandos deben terminar correctamente y mostrar el mismo resumen SHA-256. Si difieren, la clave privada no corresponde al certificado seleccionado. Vuelve a localizar la pareja correcta antes de instalarla."},"2345":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#comprueba-que-la-clave-corresponde","content":"Las opciones utilizadas se recogen en openssl-x509 y openssl-pkey."},"2346":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Resultado"},"2347":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Qué revisar"},"2348":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"La CA rechaza la emisión"},"2349":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Permisos, estado y clave de la CA, algoritmo y perfil."},"2350":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Sujeto o usos diferentes"},"2351":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Perfil aplicado y valores solicitados."},"2352":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"No se encuentra el emisor"},"2353":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"CA descargada y cadena intermedia necesaria."},"2354":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Falla la vigencia"},"2355":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Fechas del certificado y de la CA, y reloj del equipo."},"2356":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Los resúmenes de clave difieren"},"2357":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Archivos de certificado y clave de la misma emisión."},"2358":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Consulta Diagnóstico PKI si necesitas acotar un fallo de emisión."},"2359":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Has completado el recorrido PKI cuando el certificado verifica y su clave corresponde. Elige cómo utilizarlo:"},"2360":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Gestionar certificados para inspección, estado y revocación."},"2361":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Registrar un dispositivo manualmente para asociar esta identidad al inventario de Lamassu."},"2362":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Preparar EST para que el dispositivo solicite sus siguientes identidades."},"2363":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"La aceptación en un consumidor requiere configurar su confianza, su comprobación de revocación y los permisos concedidos a la identidad."},"2364":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"page","content":"Primeros pasos de PKI","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","PKI","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview"},"2365":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platfor